s the attractive wedge\">\n        <div class=\"proof-row reason-1\">\n          <h3 class=\"proof-title\">Foundational to the encounter</h3>\n          <p class=\"proof-copy\">Shapes the starting point for what follows in the visit.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proof-row reason-2\">\n          <h3 class=\"proof-title\">Time-variable</h3>\n          <p class=\"proof-copy\">Time required depends on complexity, communication, and context.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"proof-row reason-3 last\">\n          <h3 class=\"proof-title\">Can begin before the encounter</h3>\n          <p class=\"proof-copy\">A meaningful portion can start before the clinician is on the clock.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"bottom-truth\"><span class=\"emph\">But reclaiming those minutes still requires clinical judgment.</span></p>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <img\n        class=\"footer-logo\"\n        src=\"../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg\"\n        alt=\"\"\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\n      />\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>"
